<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0F4C45;text-wrap:balance">Most agencies build you a website. We build you a system that works for your business every day.</p>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:58ch">The HazirMinds AI-Powered Website is a custom website we design and build for your business, with built-in AI chat and voice that capture and qualify visitors. It answers from your approved knowledge, day or night, and hands every qualified lead to your team.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px"><a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call?solve=Website%20not%20bringing%20in%20leads" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,box-shadow .15s">Book a Discovery Call</a><a class="x2" href="#demo" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s">Try the sample assistant</a></div>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#585E5A;max-width:52ch">Happy with a simple site and only need our AI services? A <a href="#compare">free static website</a> comes with any AI service.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(15,76,69,.10),0 2px 6px rgba(26,33,31,.05);overflow:hidden">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6;background:#F5F1EA"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A;margin-left:12px">Website chat</span><span style="flex:1"></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F7ECD6;color:#7A4E00;font-weight:600;font-size:12px">Sample data</span></div>
<div style="padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#E3EDE9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">chat</span></span><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:17px">Website visitor</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Chat · 9:42 p.m.</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#E5F0E8;color:#1E6B3E;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#1E6B3E">check</span>Qualified</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">
<div style="align-self:flex-start;max-width:88%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 4px;background:#E3EDE9"><b style="font-size:13px;color:#0F4C45">AI</b><br>Hi, I'm an AI assistant for Oakline Home Services. How can I help?</div>
<div style="align-self:flex-end;max-width:80%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px 12px 4px 12px;background:#F5F1EA"><b style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A">Visitor</b><br>I'd like a quote for a kitchen remodel.</div>
<div style="align-self:flex-start;max-width:88%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 4px;background:#E3EDE9"><b style="font-size:13px;color:#0F4C45">AI</b><br>I can set that up. What's your name, and when's a good time for the team to call?</div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:12px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #EEE8DE">
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">person_add</span><div><b style="font-size:14px">Lead captured</b><p style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A">Marcus L.</p></div></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">schedule</span><div><b style="font-size:14px">Best time</b><p style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A">Weekday mornings</p></div></div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="ps-h" style="background:#EAF0F8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="ps-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Problems it solves</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Three everyday problems the AI-Powered Website takes off your plate.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Website just sits there, no leads</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">The AI-driven site actively captures and qualifies visitors.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Visitors leave with questions unanswered</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Built-in AI chat and voice answer from your approved knowledge, any time.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Leads arrive with no context</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Each lead comes with the conversation that qualified it.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="get-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="get-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">What you get</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:44ch">Everything in the AI-Powered Website service.</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:16px">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#2B5C8F">link</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">A custom website, built for you</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Designed around your business, and connected to your other HazirMinds services.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#2B5C8F">chat</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Built-in AI chat</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Visitors get answers from your approved knowledge, day or night.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#2B5C8F">record_voice_over</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Built-in AI voice</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Visitors can talk instead of type.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#2B5C8F">person_add</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Visitor capture and qualification</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">It asks your qualifying questions and captures contact details.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#2B5C8F">cloud_done</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Managed hosting</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Monitoring, maintenance and updates included.</p></div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="how-h" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="how-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">How it works</h2>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:24px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #2B5C8F"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#2B5C8F">Step 1</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We learn what your visitors ask</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your common questions, and what a good lead looks like for you.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #8A5A00"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#8A5A00">Step 2</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We set it up with your approved knowledge</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your answers, your qualifying questions and your rules. Nothing else.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #A23E1E"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#A23E1E">Step 3</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">It talks with your visitors</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">By chat or voice. It introduces itself as an AI, then answers, qualifies and captures contact details.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #0F6B57"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#0F6B57">Step 4</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">You review, we refine</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You see conversations and leads. We measure the results and adjust with you.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="lane-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DCE7E4">AI governance</p><h2 id="lane-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-wrap:balance">How the AI stays in its lane</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:44ch">The same rules apply to every conversation, for every client.</p><a href="/security" style="color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:8px">Security &amp; data protection →</a></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">record_voice_over</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It introduces itself as an AI at the start of every conversation.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">menu_book</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It answers only from your approved knowledge. It does not invent answers.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">rule</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It asks only the qualifying questions you approve.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">support_agent</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">When it's unsure, it says so and passes the visitor to a person on your team.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">lock</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Conversations and contact details stay in your own isolated environment.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<AssistantDemo />
