<div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Custom build · quoted for you</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3">AI-Powered Website</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">For businesses that want the website itself to capture and qualify visitors.</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>A custom design, built around your business</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Built-in AI chat and voice</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Visitor capture and qualification</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Leads passed to your team with the full conversation</li>
